{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and run your own smoke shop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smoke Shop Simulator</strong> is a supermarket-style shop management simulation where you build, manage, and grow your own smoke shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small store, place shelves, order products, manage stock, and serve customers. As your business grows, you\u2019ll unlock new upgrades, improve efficiency, and turn a simple shop into a thriving operation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 Start From Scratch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/7b093e92d7de60755edf575cbc0aefe3.poster.avif?t=1765675396\" width=500 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/7b093e92d7de60755edf575cbc0aefe3.webm?t=1765675396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with an empty shop and limited resources.<br>Place basic shelves, purchase products using your in-game computer, manage inventory, and make your first sales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters as you try to keep your shop profitable and organized.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Manage Stock &amp; Products</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/b3793d4704599828894b9f922f3ae485.poster.avif?t=1765675396\" width=500 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/b3793d4704599828894b9f922f3ae485.webm?t=1765675396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shelves stocked and your customers happy.<br>Order new products, track inventory, and make sure popular items are always available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poor stock management can lead to lost sales and unhappy customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 Serve Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/1304ec4d85d2643c6a8488daa83dc5ae.webp?t=1765675396\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/1304ec4d85d2643c6a8488daa83dc5ae.poster.avif?t=1765675396\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=312 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers arrive throughout the day with different needs and behaviors.<br>Serve them efficiently, manage checkout flow, and keep the shop running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-organized store means faster service and higher profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf Progress &amp; Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/4cac020cd10efc9ab23f46a73af90567.webp?t=1765675396\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/4cac020cd10efc9ab23f46a73af90567.poster.avif?t=1765675396\" class=\"bb_img\" width=298 height=27 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP, level up, and unlock new upgrades.<br>Improve your shop layout, increase capacity, and optimize your workflow to grow faster and earn more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression rewards smart planning and efficient management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supermarket-style shop management gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf placement and shop customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Product purchasing and inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer AI and daily routines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XP and leveling system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea7 Early Access Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/33321ee322047d99ba35adda98c06ddb.poster.avif?t=1765675396\" width=498 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/extras/33321ee322047d99ba35adda98c06ddb.webm?t=1765675396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smoke Shop Simulator is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong> and actively being developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current version focuses on the core shop management experience.<br>New content, improvements, and additional systems will be added over time based on player feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smoke Shop Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build it. Manage it. Grow it.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670920?t=1765675396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/206756cd194896298a7306d17cd1a6ea90eb4176/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765675396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/78760992c35ae7c70b912d44d0cf382eb8327921/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765675396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670920/78760992c35ae7c70b912d44d0cf382eb8327921/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765675396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mature themes includ